\begin{enumerate}[label=\arabic*.]
\item For every $n\geq0$, if the integers $b_k$ and $c_k$ are defined for every $1\leq k\leq n$, then if $$\alpha = [0;b_1,\ldots,b_{n}] + [0;c_1,\ldots,c_{n}]\,,$$ 
