\section{Libraries used}\label{supp:library}
Analysis was conducted in Python and R using the following packages:
\begin{enumerate}
    \item Python Package \texttt{gensim}~\cite{rehurek_lrec} v4.3.0 for producing CBG embeddings
    \item Python Package \texttt{Umap}~\cite{McInnes2018} for dimension reduction for CBG embeddings.
