  \includegraphics[width = \linewidth]{fig2_plotccr}
  \caption{Plots returned by \texttt{plot(ccrFortune)}. In the last plot, efficient DMUs are represented by green circles and inefficient DMUs by red circles. In each inefficient DMU, there are arrows pointing to the DMUs of its corresponding reference set. Moreover, the size of the circle of an efficient DMU depends on the relevance of this DMU in the reference sets.}
  \label{fig:plotccr}
