Input 1&Crisp&\texttt{mL}.\\
Input 2&Trapezoidal (non-symmetric)&\texttt{mL}, \texttt{mR}, \texttt{dL}, \texttt{dR}\\
Input 3& Symmetric triangular&\texttt{mL}, \texttt{dL}\\
