\textbf{\execution module} maps LLM-generated actions to executable formats. The module prompts a specialized LLM agent to convert a given text action into an executable vector format. If the textual action does not fit into an executable action format, it re-prompts the agent, ensuring the agent properly interacts within action constraints. More information can be found in the Appendix.


