Now since all agents have an active action (including $\texttt{No Action}$), each agent will generate an executable vector ($e_a$) through our \execution Module in line 19. If the current action ($action_a$) is complete or single-step, it will then be set to $\texttt{None}$ and appended to the agent's action history.

Lastly, all executable tensors will be combined and executed within the Wildfire Environment in line 24. If the max score has been reached, the algorithm ends.

