\begin{enumerate}\item  $\Ext^1(-, f)$ is an equivalence over $\Gp(R)$. \item  $\Ext^1(f, -)$ is an equivalence over $\Gp(R)$. \item  $\Tor_1(f, -)$ is an equivalence over $\Gp(R^{op})$.
