  \slashed{x} \gamma^{\nu} + x^{\rho} \gamma^{\mu} \slashed{x} \gamma^{\nu}
  \right)}{48 \pi^{d / 2} (- x^2)^{d / 2 - 1}} \right] g G_{\mu \nu ; \rho}^a
