Figure~\ref{fig:transparency_saturationthresh_inversion_gain_1}(b) tracks the evolution of the net photon count, which includes photons from both stimulated and spontaneous emissions as the ions transition between levels. This visualization allows us to pinpoint the precise moments of gain saturation, achieve transparency, and reach inversion. 

