Let $\eps>0$ be a constant, $p\geq(1+\eps)n^{-1/3}$, $\mathbf{G}\sim G_{n,p}$, and $\mathbf{X}=X^{(2)}(\mathbf{G})$. Then, \whp\ $\mathbf{X}$ is simply connected.
