\begin{observation}\label{obs: union of complexes}
    For subprocesses $\mathbf{A}_1,\mathbf{A}_2\subseteq \mathbf{A}$ we have $K(\mathbf{A}_1\cup \mathbf{A}_2)=K(\mathbf{A}_1)\cup K(\mathbf{A}_2)$.
