Finally, we can obtain 3-pairs of 9-channel tensor $L_{in} =  \left(\{ L_l,H_l,G_l \},\{ L_m,H_m,G_m \},\{ L_h,H_h,G_h \} \right)$ as the input to feed into the EFSM module.
