%and a given order of simple anyons $n_a$ (where for $a$ being a simple anyon, $n_a\in\bbN$ is the corresponding order), we present it with a matrix
%\be  \rho_\CA = \sum_{a,b} N_{a,b} E(n_a,n_b)  \ , \ee
