        (a) Local off-resonant emitters yield chiral atom-photon bound states whose photonic profile decays exponentially with aperiodic modulation.
        (b) DOS and integrated DOS of the effective emitter Hamiltonian showing its critical behavior. Parameter values: $t_B=0.2\,t_A$, $g=0.05\,t_A$.
